        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sī ya ng'weli ya Yolodani kūgabanhyiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī sī īji hū jene ījo Baisilaeli bakapandīka kūbiza wingīji wabo ū mu sī ya Kanaani. Bakagabanhyiwa na Elieza ū ngabīji, hamò na Yoshwa ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nuni, mu kūgunanhwa na batongeeji ba ndūgū ja Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'anda īji kenda na nusu jikagabanhyiwa ū wingīji wajo mu nzīla ya kweesa mbale, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī walagīīlīla mu nzīla ya ng'wa Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa walī wamala kūbinha a banhū ba ng'anda īj'ibīlī na nusu ū wingīji wabo kū ntambūko gwa kīya ya mongo gwa Yolodani, alīyo a Balawī walī atabinhile ū wingīji hamò na a bichaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bitūnja ba ng'wa Yosefu ū Manase nū Efulaimu-baalī bashika magele abīlī ga ng'anda. Na lūūlū a Balawī batanukūlile ngabo ū mu wingīji wa sī, ī mizengo ī yene bakanukūla būpandīka ha kwikala, na a madīīmīlo ga madaale ga ng'holo na ng'ombe jabo bakapandīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a Baisilaeli bīīgabanha lūūlū ī sī, gīt'ūmo SEEBA waalī wanagīīla Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kelebu kwinhwa Hebuloni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba Yuda būng'wegeela ū Yoshwa aho bataalī Giligaali, ū Kekebu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yafune wa lūdūgū lwa Bakeni ūng'wīla ū Yoshwa gīkī, “Ūdeebile ūmo SEEBA walī wang'wīlīla ū Musa ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu aho tūlī Kadeeshi-balinea, ū mu mihayo yako ū bebe hamò nū nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikū jene Musa ntūmami o ng'wa SEEBA akanitūma kūfuma Kadeeshi-balinea kwiza kūdata sī, naalī na myaka makūmi anè. Aho nashoka nūng'wenhela mhola ja kūlenganīla nū mumo yalī īzunīgije ī ng'holò yane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a badūgū bane, abo baalī baaja hamò naane, būbakanga a banhū bogoha; ū nene nanondeelaga SEEBA Mulungu wane na ng'holò īmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo ū Musa ūnilahīlīla alīhaya, ‘Ī sī īyo mhambala jaako jīpandaga īkūbiza ya wingīji wako, hamò na a baana bako weleelo bose, nguno wanondeelaga ū SEEBA Mulungu wane na ng'holò īmò.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Al'ī haha angū ūlībona gīkī ū SEEBA wagūshikīlīgije ūyo walī waniisagīja, ūūyū wanilang'hanile pyī ī myaka makūmi anè ī yose īyī, kūfuma aho akang'wīlīla Musa ng'wikanza lya Baisilaeli kūyeela yeela ū ng'witogolo; ī lelo nalī na myaka makūmi anaane n'ītanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nataalī na nguzu gīt'ūmo naalī aho Musa wanitūmīlaga; ī nguzu ījo nalī najo ī haha jidūgije kūnigunanha nūūlū kūja mu būlūgū gīt'ūmo nīītīlaga dūhū ū mu shikū jenījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ninhage ī sī ya lūgūlū yenīyī gīt'ūmo akaniisagīja ū SEEBA ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo. Bebe ng'wenekīlī ūkigwa ī gīkī balīho Baanaki, abo mizengo yabo īlī mitaale; hama īlī na ngītīli ja nguzu; alīyo nakūbapeeja dūhū kūlwa būgunanhi o ng'wa SEEBA, gīt'ūmo wei ng'wenekīlī ahayīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yoshwa ūmfuuha ū Kelebu ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yefune, ūng'winha ng'hana ī Hebuloni kūbiza ya wingīji wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūfuma ikanza lyenīlo ī Hebuloni yūbiza ya ng'wa Kelebu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yefune, wa mu lūdūgū lwa Bakeni; nguno wanondeelaga na ng'holò īmò ū SEEBA Mulungu wa Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ī Hebuloni yitanagwa ī kwandya Kiliati-alaba, kūlwa kūng'wizūkwa Alaba ūyo walī abalilwe kūbiza munhū ntaale ū mu Baanaki.) Hūna ī sī yifuula ū būlūgū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
